    <string name="widget_analog_mode">Minimal analog clock (with seconds hand)</string>
    <string name="widget_analog_mode_note">Uses a custom dial with hour, minute, and seconds hands. Dial markings follow the widget text colour; the hands use a fixed white design. Android 17+ keeps the seconds hand synchronized with system time when the widget becomes visible again. Older Android versions use a launcher-side animation that some launchers may resume at its previous position. Digital display settings are retained when you switch back.</string>
    <string name="widget_analog_mode_help">Uses a custom SecondsClock dial with hour, minute, and seconds hands. It schedules no recurring app alarms. Android 17+ keeps the seconds hand synchronized with system time when visible; older Android versions use a launcher-side animation that may resume at its previous position after hiding the widget. Dial markings follow the widget text colour, while hands are fixed white. Digital display settings are retained.</string>
